        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", who shall abide in thy tabernacle? who shall dwell in thy holy hill?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that walketh uprightly, and worketh righteousness, and speaketh the truth in his heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "He that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.15.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.15.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "backbiteth not with his tongue, nor doeth evil to his neighbour, nor taketh up a reproach against his neighbour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In whose eyes a vile person is contemned; but he honoureth them that fear the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.15.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.15.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "He that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.15.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.15.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sweareth to",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his own",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.15.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.15.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hurt, and changeth not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "He that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.15.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.15.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "putteth not out his money to usury, nor taketh reward against the innocent. He that doeth these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.15.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.15.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall never be moved.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
